  "details": "If you interrupt a download (Say by swapping worlds while a avatar is still downloading/loading)\nAll future downloading content (Worlds or avatars) will still download. but will no longer \"load\" into game (Aka will not load from cache) \nSo you can not load into another world nor load peoples avatars.\nBug been around now for a few builds in game. \nFix is a game restart.",
